1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Meet FinRecon AI, an AI-powered Finance Controller designed to close the financial reconciliation loop.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:45,000
Finance teams compare multiple sources to understand whether money actually settled correctly.

3
00:00:45,000 --> 00:01:00,000
A reproducible synthetic dataset: 150 payments, 146 settlements, 150 ledger entries, and 29 exception scenarios.

4
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Payment, settlement, and ledger records are brought together so the reconciliation result can be inspected.

5
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:45,000
152 records evaluated. 86.18% reconciliation match rate. 8 auto-resolved. 21 left for investigation.

6
00:01:45,000 --> 00:02:00,000
100% classification accuracy against deterministic synthetic ground truth. 0 false matches. 0 missed exceptions.

7
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:30,000
AI explains the evidence and recommends a manual cross-check. It does not decide the financial truth.

8
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Human review keeps financial decisions under control, and every action is recorded in the audit trail.

9
00:02:50,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Current cash: ₹11,10,071.20. Pending settlements: ₹1,10,071.20.

10
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:30,000
One-day, three-day, and seven-day projected balances use a transparent moving-average model.

11
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:55,000
The Finance Assistant answers free-text questions from the current reconciliation dataset.

12
00:03:55,000 --> 00:04:00,000
Deterministic truth. Human control. Cash intelligence. FinRecon AI, AI Finance Controller.
